{"product_id":"obsidian-crown-handcrafted-custom-pool-cue-cues-master","title":"Obsidian Crown – Handcrafted Custom Pool Cue | Elite Cue","description":"\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eDark, refined, and unmistakably luxurious, the \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eObsidian Crown\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e is a handcrafted custom pool cue defined by the dramatic contrast of \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eblack-stained Canadian maple\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e and shimmering natural abalone. Its sophisticated design embraces understated luxury, allowing the rich dark finish and intricate handcrafted details to command attention without excess.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003epremium Canadian maple\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e is carefully stained in deep black, creating a sleek, uniform foundation that allows the meticulously handcrafted \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eabalone inlays\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e to take center stage. Slender inlay elements flow elegantly through the forearm and butt sleeve, revealing flashes of natural iridescence against the dark finish and creating remarkable depth and movement.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe handle is finished with a premium \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eblack crocodile wrap\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, adding distinctive texture, luxurious character, and a comfortable feel in the hand. Its rich surface complements the polished black maple while reinforcing the cue's bold and sophisticated identity.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSubtle \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003ecustom decorative ringwork\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e provides clean definition throughout the cue, while the precision \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eRadial pin\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e delivers a solid and secure connection between the butt and shaft.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCreated for discerning players and collectors who appreciate quiet luxury and exceptional craftsmanship, the Obsidian Crown brings together dark Canadian maple, natural abalone artistry, and refined detailing in one commanding design.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSpecifications\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWood:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Premium Black-Stained Canadian Maple\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eInlays:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Handcrafted Abalone Inlays\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWrap:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Premium Black Crocodile Wrap\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eRingwork:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Custom Decorative Ringwork\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePin:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Radial\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eConstruction:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Handcrafted Custom Cue\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBrand:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Elite Cue\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\